# Mac mini runtime version pins — the desired state, in the repo.
#
# COMMITTED ON PURPOSE (not gitignored like services/*/.env): Renovate reads
# this file. `renovate.json` has a customManagers entry whose regex matches the
# `# renovate:` comment below plus the assignment under it. Reformat carefully —
# if the regex stops matching, Renovate goes quiet and you learn about the next
# Ollama release the way we learned about 0.33.3: by a model pull failing.
#
# See docs/MAC_MINI.md.

# The Ollama Mac app. Upgrading this REPLACES /Applications/Ollama.app, so it is
# never applied by the timer — a human runs `install.sh --upgrade-ollama`.
# renovate: datasource=github-releases depName=ollama/ollama
OLLAMA_VERSION=0.33.3
